description: "GitHub issue #1327 records Nightly Validation run 36310799887 at main 2b14d2fdee9d65dd1699d79e617ab53a0ae91dc7. Windows Node 24 shard 2/2 failed the read-only static extension inventory unreadable-roots/sources integration case: expected managed_state_unreadable plus source detail but received extensions_unreadable. This is separate from shard 1 init test timeouts. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1327"
