goal: project management = context management
objective: Static extension inventory reports precise unreadable-source receipts consistently on Windows
value: Preserve trustworthy read-only extension diagnostics across platforms
impact: Avoid masking a missing managed-state reason behind a generic extensions_unreadable result
outcome: Windows nightly shard 2 verifies precise refusal semantics without altering inventory safety
